graph TD
    Start([Production Deployment Request]) --> Plan[DeploymentPlanAgent<br/>Generate Plan]
    
    Plan --> Validate[Validate Plan<br/>Check Risk Level]
    
    Validate -->|Risk > Threshold| Reject1([REJECTED<br/>Risk Too High])
    Validate -->|Risk OK| Stage[Staging Simulation<br/>StagingSimulator]
    
    Stage --> StageValidate[StagingValidationAgent<br/>Validate Results]
    
    StageValidate -->|Failures| Fix[Fix Issues]
    Fix --> Stage
    StageValidate -->|Pass| Supervisor[SupervisorAgent<br/>Review & Approve]
    
    Supervisor -->|Rejected| Reject2([REJECTED<br/>Supervisor Denied])
    Supervisor -->|Approved| CTO[CTOAgent<br/>Review & Approve]
    
    CTO -->|Rejected| Reject3([REJECTED<br/>CTO Denied])
    CTO -->|Approved| ProdAgent[ProductionDeploymentAgent<br/>Final Evaluation]
    
    ProdAgent -->|Rejected| Reject4([REJECTED<br/>Production Agent Denied])
    ProdAgent -->|Approved| CheckMode{Impact Mode?}
    
    CheckMode -->|Not FULL_IMPACT| Reject5([REJECTED<br/>Requires FULL_IMPACT])
    CheckMode -->|FULL_IMPACT| Snapshot[RollbackManager<br/>Create Snapshot]
    
    Snapshot --> SSH[SSH to VPS<br/>Validate Connection]
    
    SSH -->|Failed| Reject6([REJECTED<br/>Connection Failed])
    SSH -->|Success| Upload[Upload Artifacts<br/>Images & Config]
    
    Upload -->|Failed| Rollback1[RollbackManager<br/>Rollback]
    Upload -->|Success| Rebuild[Rebuild Containers<br/>docker-compose pull & build]
    
    Rebuild -->|Failed| Rollback2[RollbackManager<br/>Rollback]
    Rebuild -->|Success| Migrate[Apply Migrations<br/>Safely]
    
    Migrate -->|Failed| Warn1[Warning: Migration Issues<br/>Continue with Caution]
    Warn1 --> Restart
    Migrate -->|Success| Restart[Restart Services<br/>docker-compose restart]
    
    Restart -->|Failed| Rollback3[RollbackManager<br/>Rollback]
    Restart -->|Success| Health[Validate Health<br/>Check Endpoints]
    
    Health -->|Unhealthy| Monitor[RollbackManager<br/>Monitor Metrics]
    Health -->|Healthy| Monitor
    
    Monitor --> CheckMetrics{Check Metrics}
    
    CheckMetrics -->|Health < 70%| AutoRollback1[Auto Rollback<br/>Health Below Threshold]
    CheckMetrics -->|Error Rate > 10%| AutoRollback2[Auto Rollback<br/>Error Rate High]
    CheckMetrics -->|CPU > 90%| AutoRollback3[Auto Rollback<br/>CPU Spike]
    CheckMetrics -->|Memory > 90%| AutoRollback4[Auto Rollback<br/>Memory Spike]
    CheckMetrics -->|Supervisor Flag| AutoRollback5[Auto Rollback<br/>Supervisor Anomaly]
    CheckMetrics -->|All OK| Success([DEPLOYMENT SUCCESS<br/>Production Live])
    
    AutoRollback1 --> RollbackComplete[Rollback Complete<br/>Restored to Snapshot]
    AutoRollback2 --> RollbackComplete
    AutoRollback3 --> RollbackComplete
    AutoRollback4 --> RollbackComplete
    AutoRollback5 --> RollbackComplete
    
    Rollback1 --> RollbackComplete
    Rollback2 --> RollbackComplete
    Rollback3 --> RollbackComplete
    
    RollbackComplete --> Failed([DEPLOYMENT FAILED<br/>Rolled Back])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style Success fill:#d4edda
    style Failed fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject1 fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject2 fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject3 fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject4 fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject5 fill:#f8d7da
    style Reject6 fill:#f8d7da
    style Warn1 fill:#fff3cd
    style AutoRollback1 fill:#fff3cd
    style AutoRollback2 fill:#fff3cd
    style AutoRollback3 fill:#fff3cd
    style AutoRollback4 fill:#fff3cd
    style AutoRollback5 fill:#fff3cd



